{"reference":"Acts 11","book":"Acts","chapter":11,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"The Earlier Episode","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"This chapter retells the Cornelius episode. In that larger account, Peter's vision is understood chiefly in relation to God's acceptance of Gentile people, shown in shared table fellowship and their reception of the Holy Spirit.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_acts_011_df9c2aba5a2bd5b14b526ce2"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]},{"kind":"why_it_matters","title":"The Point of Peter's Defense","blocks":[{"id":"block_2","text":"Peter recounts the vision, the visitors, and the Spirit's gift in sequence before the Jerusalem believers. The account therefore directs attention beyond the sheet itself: its conclusion is the recognition that Gentiles too have received repentance leading to life, rather than an isolated instruction about food.","verse_refs":["Acts 11:1-18"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_acts_011_c91965cba1718e39d036cb2f"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]},{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"Antioch and Later Comparisons","blocks":[{"id":"block_3","text":"Acts presents Antioch as a multilingual center of leadership and mission, and it places the first use of the name “Christians” for the disciples there. The chapter also introduces Saul's work with Barnabas in Antioch and their later journey with relief for Judea.","verse_refs":["Acts 11:19-30","Acts 11:27-30"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_acts_011_1bf21408505da62fe580f3a2"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"},{"id":"block_4","text":"Readers comparing Acts 11:27-30 with Galatians 1–2 encounter differences in what the accounts select, emphasize, and sequence concerning Paul's call and Jerusalem contacts. Exact harmonizations remain disputed, so the accounts are best compared passage by passage rather than treated as automatically identical or automatically contradictory.","verse_refs":["Acts 11:27-30"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_acts_011_0f931e016f475a8c927b0f73"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}